    <a class="footer-brand" href="/">Nicolas Khobelia<span>Objects with character.</span></a>
    <div class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer navigation">
      <a href="/works/">Collection</a><a href="/about/">Studio</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
